== the gate with no run open
manifest naming present chunks: ok
manifest naming an absent chunk: corrupt/missing_chunks
refused manifest not written: true
folder marker: ok
JSON that is not a folder marker: invalid
folder index (internal leaf): ok
body that is neither: invalid
claim naming an absent chunk: corrupt/missing_chunks
copy into the version area: ok

== a run opens: R written, S renamed to F
get one: "one"; head two: true; range one: "ne"
chunk put lands in S: true
listing the chunk area: two one four
listing one shard: two
listing the domain names no outgoing key: true

== publications during the run promote
put promotes one: in S true, in F false
copy promotes two: in S true, in F false
delete removes both spaces: S false, F false

== the publish lock orders publications with the collector
publication waits while the lock is held: true
a record naming no chunk does not wait: ok
publication completes once released: true

== the run ends
promoted chunks read: true true
absent chunk: none
